@startuml seq-mail-discovery
title UC-18 / UC-19 · Structures named in in-game mails reach the Structures page, the Search tab and the Wars lists
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber
actor "Pilot" as pilot
actor "Member" as user
participant "Browser UI\n(structures.js + multiselect.js)" as ui
participant "Routes" as web
participant "StructureScout\n(_mail_scan, effective())" as scout
participant "mailscan.py" as parser
participant "CharacterService" as chars
participant "ESI" as esi
database "SQLite" as db

pilot -> esi : in-game: drag a structure link and its owner corporation's link into a mail
note over pilot, esi : the mail is sent to a character that granted esi-mail.read_mail.v1

== hourly scout run (after the dock search) or Resolve unknown (first, forced) ==
loop each character with the mail scope that is due (mail_refresh_minutes, 60)
  scout -> chars : access_token(character, owner)
  loop up to mail_max_pages (4), while the page is new and younger than mail_max_age_days (30)
    scout -> esi : GET /characters/{id}/mail/?last_mail_id=... (cache=False)
    esi --> scout : 50 headers (mail_id, timestamp; subject, sender and recipients are ignored)
  end
  scout -> db : mail_reads: skip mails already parsed (mail IDs are global); scout_mail.last_mail_id
  loop each new mail, oldest first
    scout -> esi : GET /characters/{id}/mail/{mail_id}/ (cache=False)
    esi --> scout : body (HTML with showinfo links)
    scout -> parser : structure_finds(body, is_structure_type)
    parser --> scout : [structure_id, type_id, name, owner_id] (body dropped, nothing else kept)
    scout -> db : structure_mail_finds (newer mail replaces, older fills gaps), known_structures (status new), mail_reads
  end
  scout -> db : scout_mail (checked_at, mails, found, error)
end
scout -> scout : a scan that stored finds bumps version (effective() and index() are rebuilt)
note over scout, esi : passing errors (0, 420, 429, 5xx) keep the character due; 401 / 403 wait the whole interval;\nthe scan stops at 60 ESI errors left and on cancel

== the structure is read with ESI as usual ==
loop each known structure still unresolved
  scout -> chars : token of a character that has assets there (or the main)
  scout -> esi : GET /universe/structures/{id}
  esi --> scout : name, owner_id, solar_system_id, type_id (403: next character, 404: gone)
  scout -> db : UPDATE known_structures (live ESI data wins over the mail find)
end

== a member looks ==
user -> ui : open Structures (Shared list, source "named in mails") or Search
ui -> web : GET /api/structures?source=mail  |  GET /api/structures/suggest, /api/structures/search
web -> scout : listing() / search() read effective()
scout -> db : known_structures, structure_mail_finds, public_structure_history
scout --> web : rows: live ESI > mail find > public datasets (mail: date, owner)
web --> ui : rows with jumps, "Named in a mail" and known / unknown
user -> ui : Wars page, Structures at war tab
ui -> web : GET /api/wars/structures
web -> scout : index() (structures with owner and system, mail finds included)
web --> ui : structures of both sides of active wars in all space
@enduml
